{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tHoGd4yMcs1793606865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港金融科技周揭幕，行政長官李家超指，會確保企業具備資金及聯繫，從香港拓展至海內外市場。金管局同時公布，今年內會將「轉數快」，接通銀聯國際，支援全球逾一億個商戶。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204119-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E5%91%A8%E6%8F%AD%E5%B9%95%E9%87%91%E7%AE%A1%E5%B1%80%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%A7%E5%B0%87%E8%BD%89%E6%95%B8%E5%BF%AB%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%9A%E9%8A%80%E8%81%AF%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>香港金融科技周揭幕　金管局︰今年內將「轉數快」接通銀聯國際</strong></a></p><p></p><p>一連五日香港法律周展開，國際統一私法協會設在本港的亞太聯絡辦公室亦同步揭幕。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204118-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%91%A8%E5%B1%95%E9%96%8B%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%81%E6%B3%95%E5%8D%94%E6%9C%83%E4%BA%9E%E5%A4%AA%E8%81%AF%E7%B5%A1%E8%BE%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%A4%E6%8F%AD%E5%B9%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>香港法律周展開　國際統一私法協會亞太聯絡辦公室揭幕</strong></a></p><p></p><p>近期多個行業第三方服務供應商懷疑資料外洩。私隱專員公署指，接獲99宗投訴及查詢，單宗最大損失達150萬元。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204121-%E7%A7%81%E9%9A%B1%E7%BD%B2%E6%8E%A5%E7%8D%B299%E5%AE%97%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%BE%9B%E6%87%89%E5%95%86%E7%96%91%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E5%A4%96%E6%B4%A9%E6%8A%95%E8%A8%B4%E5%8F%8A%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>私隱署︰接獲99宗第三方服務供應商疑資料外洩投訴及查詢</strong></a></p><p></p><p>警方拘捕一名男子涉嫌狂亂駕駛，撞毀港珠澳大橋檢查亭。警方透過「銳眼計劃」追蹤私家車，早上在屯門拘捕疑犯。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204115-%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E6%B6%89%E7%8B%82%E4%BA%82%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E6%92%9E%E6%AF%80%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3%E5%A4%A7%E6%A9%8B%E6%AA%A2%E6%9F%A5%E4%BA%AD%E8%AD%A6%E9%80%8F%E9%81%8E%E9%8A%B3%E7%9C%BC%E8%A8%88%E5%8A%83%E5%B1%AF%E9%96%80%E6%8B%98%E6%8D%95%E7%96%91%E7%8A%AF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>男子涉狂亂駕駛撞毀港珠澳大橋檢查亭　警透過「銳眼計劃」屯門拘捕疑犯</strong></a></p><p></p><p>廉政公署起訴一間清潔公司兩名時任高層，涉嫌就採購清潔車輛及維修服務收賄逾7,500萬元。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204084-%E5%BB%89%E7%BD%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%A8%B4%E6%B8%85%E6%BD%94%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%85%A9%E5%90%8D%E6%99%82%E4%BB%BB%E9%AB%98%E5%B1%A4%E6%B6%89%E6%8E%A1%E8%B3%BC%E6%B8%85%E6%BD%94%E8%BB%8A%E8%BC%9B%E5%8F%8A%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E6%94%B6%E8%B3%84\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>廉署起訴清潔公司兩名時任高層　涉採購清潔車輛及維修服務收賄</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:44.162899+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:58:13.348388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:52.503508+00:00","content_hash":"b2c7b55d425724258dcfc0aa3472d5d070d4b6057c3a7563ab2ce34193d641fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:44.162899+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}